# Cloudflare Pages, Cloudflare Workers static assets, and Netlify read this file. Other hosts need the same headers.
#
# Every page: a Content-Security-Policy (security campaign E-5a, U-89).
# - frame-ancestors: only this app and the Safe UIs the admin pages run in as a Safe App (U-27), so no other site can
#   frame a button. Keep it in step with `safeUi` in deployments/*.json and SAFE_ORIGINS in lib/safe.ts.
# - connect-src: the network RPCs in deployments/*.json, Supabase (edge functions and receipt uploads), and what
#   Privy and WalletConnect need for sign-in and wallets.
# - script-src needs 'unsafe-inline': a static export inlines Next's bootstrap scripts and can't carry a nonce.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://challenges.cloudflare.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; font-src 'self' data:; media-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://*.supabase.co https://rpc.frax.com https://rpc.testnet.frax.com https://ethereum-sepolia-rpc.publicnode.com https://auth.privy.io https://*.privy.io https://*.rpc.privy.systems https://*.walletconnect.com https://*.walletconnect.org wss://relay.walletconnect.com wss://relay.walletconnect.org https://api.web3modal.org wss://www.walletlink.org; frame-src https://auth.privy.io https://verify.walletconnect.com https://verify.walletconnect.org https://challenges.cloudflare.com; child-src https://auth.privy.io https://verify.walletconnect.com https://verify.walletconnect.org; worker-src 'self' blob:; manifest-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'self' https://app.safe.global https://safe.mainnet.frax.com https://safe.testnet.frax.com
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
# Frax's Safe UI fetches the Safe App manifest and icon from another origin, so they need CORS (SYSTEM_DESIGN 6.4,
# docs/RUNBOOK.md step 10).
/manifest.json
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
/admin/manifest.json
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
/brand/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
# the hero footage loops every 16 seconds; without a cache lifetime the browser re-checks it each loop and stutters
/images/landing/earth*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
